# AWS screenshots stay local until their provenance and redaction have been reviewed.
/web/public/aws/thumbs/

# Private research and local review material: publish only after explicit review.
/data
/benchmark/
/docs/
/DESIGN.md
/PRODUCT.md
/REPORT.md
/RATING_GUIDE.md

# OS
.DS_Store

